  "whatThisAppTeaches": "What this app teaches",
  "aboutBody": "Qiraah Arabiyyah covers everything a classical Qaidah does — the 28 letters and their joined forms, every mark of tashkīl with exact count timing (1 · 2 · 4 · 6), tajwīd from ghunnah to qalqalah — and adds a strict stroke-direction tracing studio, a dyslexia-friendly Reading Coach for look-alike letters, a full offline Qur’an reader in Madani and IndoPak scripts with word-by-word audio, and an advanced hall on the ten canonical Qirā’āt.\n\nIt is a study companion, not a substitute for a teacher: recitation and the Qirā’āt are transmitted person to person, and we encourage every learner to find a qualified teacher with ijāzah.",
  "creditsGratitude": "Credits & gratitude",
  "creditMarkazBody": "The word-by-word recitation that powers tap-to-hear across the entire Qur’an Reader is the work of Markaz Tafsir, served via QuranCDN. May Allah reward them — this app would not be what it is without their recordings.",
